General Behavior, Touch: "In Tablet Mode: Hide panels automatically", on by default (ORDER 567; plasmarc,
[TabletMode] HidePanels). plasma-workspace 4:6.7.4-2+stereo3d8 reads it: while the computer is in tablet mode
every panel is on automatic hide, and each goes back to the person's own setting afterwards
(plasma-desktop-tablet-mode-panels-switch.patch).

The switch, its label and its help text in the nine translated languages
(plasma-desktop-tablet-mode-panels.po.patch, last in the series).
